E AX3021 510-decl-macro-template-kind.ax:19:10-12 macro-template-unsupported "macro `defAlias`'s template may generate `fn`, `::`, `data`, `struct` and `impl` declarations, further macro invocations, or a syntax/for over them - this form is not supported yet" !"type, trait, effect and import templates refuse here, at the macro's own line, rather than passing through silently (MAC-CAP-2). An import inside a template would reopen resolution ordering and a nested macro the phase-D fixpoint, which is why those two are refusals by decision rather than by schedule" ?"generate the declaration by hand, or split it out of the template"
